Package: cointegrationtools
Type: Package
Title: Teaching-Oriented Tools for Single-Equation Cointegration
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Miguel A.", "Arranz", email = "maarranz@eco.uc3m.es",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-5951-2284",
                affiliation = "Universidad Carlos III de Madrid"))
Description: Single-equation cointegration analysis, developed for Applied
    Time Series Econometrics (ATSE) at Universidad Carlos III de Madrid:
    cointegrating regressions estimated by OLS, fully modified, dynamic and
    integrated modified OLS; the Engle-Granger and error-correction tests
    with finite-sample critical values and p-values from simulated response
    surfaces; and the error-correction model. Companion to the 'unitroottools'
    and 'adltools' packages.
